    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>JUST A GUY</strong>\u00a0is a fun and colorful physics-based adventure game with ragdoll characters. Alone or with friends, whether you're 7 or 77, explore the worlds, find the secrets, unlock the outfits or create your own fun with the game's physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/618f400734a4a0d404054fa693bd8705.poster.avif?t=1754669513\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/618f400734a4a0d404054fa693bd8705.webm?t=1754669513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/618f400734a4a0d404054fa693bd8705.mp4?t=1754669513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PHYSICS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything in this game is built around physics. Every character, every object, every vehicle is entirely physics-based. This gives the game a unique feel and creates fun new situations every time you play. Get ready to laugh, especially if you're playing with friends ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/037a82eed0d71a643a711a150240c9a9.poster.avif?t=1754669513\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/037a82eed0d71a643a711a150240c9a9.webm?t=1754669513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/037a82eed0d71a643a711a150240c9a9.mp4?t=1754669513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore all kinds of different small open worlds, from a huge bedroom to an amusement park, a water park or even the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each level, you'll find lots of activities to complete to earn cosmetic outfits. There are also plenty of secrets and easter eggs to discover ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/478fb7af6da5e991a7857fb0be366196.poster.avif?t=1754669513\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/478fb7af6da5e991a7857fb0be366196.webm?t=1754669513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/478fb7af6da5e991a7857fb0be366196.mp4?t=1754669513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your character is full of energy, you can run very fast, jump high, climb, punch, grab, throw, drive, glide, slide and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use yours arms to interact with the environment in a logical way. You see this cool car over there ? Just grab the steering wheel and gooooo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/8c062c3b8117a0d2158d47cb9afbfedc.poster.avif?t=1754669513\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/8c062c3b8117a0d2158d47cb9afbfedc.webm?t=1754669513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/8c062c3b8117a0d2158d47cb9afbfedc.mp4?t=1754669513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AGE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even if this game is designed to be playable by kids (no violence, no sex, no drugs, etc), everyone can play it and have fun ! Grab your controller, call a friend and go to explore a\u00a0 \u00a0level !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with a total of 4 friends</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 different levels to explore (and more to come)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many different activities to complete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of different vehicles to drive (cars, planes, boats,etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online co-op and offline single player</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>JUST A GUY</strong>\u00a0is a fun and colorful physics-based adventure game with ragdoll characters. Alone or with friends, whether you're 7 or 77, explore the worlds, find the secrets, unlock the outfits or create your own fun with the game's physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/618f400734a4a0d404054fa693bd8705.poster.avif?t=1754669513\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/618f400734a4a0d404054fa693bd8705.webm?t=1754669513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/618f400734a4a0d404054fa693bd8705.mp4?t=1754669513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PHYSICS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything in this game is built around physics. Every character, every object, every vehicle is entirely physics-based. This gives the game a unique feel and creates fun new situations every time you play. Get ready to laugh, especially if you're playing with friends ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/037a82eed0d71a643a711a150240c9a9.poster.avif?t=1754669513\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/037a82eed0d71a643a711a150240c9a9.webm?t=1754669513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/037a82eed0d71a643a711a150240c9a9.mp4?t=1754669513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore all kinds of different small open worlds, from a huge bedroom to an amusement park, a water park or even the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each level, you'll find lots of activities to complete to earn cosmetic outfits. There are also plenty of secrets and easter eggs to discover ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/478fb7af6da5e991a7857fb0be366196.poster.avif?t=1754669513\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/478fb7af6da5e991a7857fb0be366196.webm?t=1754669513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/478fb7af6da5e991a7857fb0be366196.mp4?t=1754669513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your character is full of energy, you can run very fast, jump high, climb, punch, grab, throw, drive, glide, slide and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use yours arms to interact with the environment in a logical way. You see this cool car over there ? Just grab the steering wheel and gooooo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/8c062c3b8117a0d2158d47cb9afbfedc.poster.avif?t=1754669513\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/8c062c3b8117a0d2158d47cb9afbfedc.webm?t=1754669513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/8c062c3b8117a0d2158d47cb9afbfedc.mp4?t=1754669513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AGE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even if this game is designed to be playable by kids (no violence, no sex, no drugs, etc), everyone can play it and have fun ! Grab your controller, call a friend and go to explore a\u00a0 \u00a0level !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with a total of 4 friends</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 different levels to explore (and more to come)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many different activities to complete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of different vehicles to drive (cars, planes, boats,etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online co-op and offline single player</p></li></ul>",
